# Xcode build output
#
# ios/DerivedData was committed (2,354 files) until the Cloudflare Pages
# migration. SwiftPM checks out capacitor-swift-pm inside it with its own .git,
# so `git add` recorded a gitlink (mode 160000) with no matching .gitmodules
# entry. That is invisible to local git but fatal to any CI that runs
# `git submodule update --init --recursive` — which is what broke the first
# Pages builds. Never commit this directory.
ios/DerivedData/
ios/App/build/
*.xcuserstate
xcuserdata/

